  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.0.0 (2026-08-15): Removed support for Net9.0 as it is out of support, added support for Net10.0, updated NuGet packages, added unit tests, fixed DtoNint and DtoNuint (protobuf-net has no serializer for nint and nuint, the values now travel as long and ulong, use the new properties Nint and Nuint), fixed the nullable DateTimeOffset property of the non nullable DtoDateTimeOffset. The two fixes change the public API, which is why the minor version is raised.",
